    skos:scopeNote "Current Adjunct Professor, teaching a semester course 'Economic transformation for post-growth flourishing' — per her own bio site (gayaherrington.com/about, WebFetch-verified 2026-07-15). Distinct from her MSc Sustainability Studies degree from the same institution, which stays prose-only on tgs:Human.GayaHerrington per this project's degree-history-stays-prose precedent — this Relationship specifically captures the CURRENT teaching role, not the historical degree."@en .

