    skos:scopeNote "Member, per her own bio site (gayaherrington.com/about, WebFetch-verified 2026-07-15). Thematically the most on-point affiliation surfaced in this bootstrap: the Club of Rome is the organization that originally commissioned the 1972 Limits to Growth study (tgs:Concept.LimitsToGrowth) she later empirically re-tested (tgs:Work.UpdateToLimitsToGrowth2021) — her membership closes a real loop between the original study's institutional origin and her own contribution to it."@en .
